# What pick lets an immortal skip: Warden (level 60, pick lock 100%) in the Cityguard HQ (3110). The east door is
# open and has no key: an immortal gets past "It's not closed." and "It can't be picked." to "It's already
# unlocked.", open or closed. A closed portal (which an immortal may enter) leads to Melancholy's Maps (3160), whose
# north door is locked and pickproof.
@connect warden
Warden
smoke123
@return
@return
pick east
@pulse 12
close east
pick east
@pulse 12
@obj 25 3110 0 3 0 3160 -1
enter gate
pick north
@pulse 12
@state
